          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Activists filed two impeachment complaints against Vice President Sara Duterte on February 2, the first day the one-year bar allowed new filings. Makabayan endorsed the first; Tindig Pilipinas, church leaders, Akbayan Rep. Perci Cendaña, and former Senator Leila de Lima backed the second. House Secretary General Cheloy Garafil later confirmed both reached Speaker Bojie Dy.</p>",
